{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_04",
  "title": "立雪求道",
  "storyCode": "BI-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ae682139f5a5b17d6bd79b4fcd36a325f1393651e87880069cfebd4a24e666a2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亲爱的，你快出来看，那是恩希欧迪斯老爷吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么可能，明天就是上山圣猎的日子了，老爷这时候不准备给圣女的供奉，一早跑到领地来视察做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等等，这还真是恩希欧迪斯老爷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说，最早人们进圣山是不许骑驮兽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其是要去拜见圣女的人们，要从跨出自家门槛的第一步开始，双掌合十，眼不离地，低着头一路祈祷过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看老爷现在的样子，莫不是他想效仿传统？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，是啊。我是听说过这种习俗，可老爷他......毕竟是老爷啊，竟然也要这么低着头一步一步走到圣山上面去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在说什么呢，老爷也是耶拉冈德的子民啊，你难道也和佩尔罗契家的傻子一样，觉得他忘了本？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在胡说什么，我哪有这个意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是替老爷担心。你又不是不知道，另外两家贪得无厌，老爷提出了把大权交给圣女，他们竟然还不太乐意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那两家嫉妒老爷带来的发展，连我们的铁路都炸了，听说是想把谢拉格封起来，然后两家一起把咱们给包了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们怎么敢？在耶拉冈德的眼前动武，祂可是会动怒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们还有什么不敢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天老爷这么手无寸铁地徒步走在街道上，明天又是三家带兵在山中打猎，真不知道他们又能做出什么伤天害理的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，可不要说这种不吉利的话！耶拉冈德在上，请保佑老爷一路平安！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上，请保佑老爷一路平安！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯老爷，没想到今日还能见到如您这样虔诚的上山参拜者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，帕莱老爷，我家主人因行大礼，必须一路虔诚祈祷，无法分心回应您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下替老爷向您致以问候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无妨无妨，是我冒犯了。耶拉冈德在上，还请原谅我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不过从图里卡姆到圣山，路程遥远，我等领民将恩希欧迪斯老爷的举止看在眼里，难免忧心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷早下定了决心，请不用为他担忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们这一队护卫也不会让老爷出任何意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格贵族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就好，愿耶拉冈德赐福于希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也愿耶拉冈德保佑您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总觉得，围猎还没有开始，野兽却已经在惊慌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您啊，只是从这窗格向外望，怎么就知道野兽在惊慌了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "积雪在发出响动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么说来，明天圣猎时，您可要小心脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_250_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......大长老到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我需要小心的麻烦事多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩雅，你可做好了准备？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行装与致辞，我都已准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请大长老放心，我已经不是第一次参与大典了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此次大典不同于往日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说，恩希欧迪斯要来参拜耶拉冈德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他愿意在这种时候表示虔诚，是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希瓦艾什前段时间还从蔓珠院请了许多神像，添置给领地里没有供奉神像的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯真的会一夜之间变得如此虔诚吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长老A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人，虔诚与否由祂注视，由祂评判，我等不能妄下断言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长老A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但即使是那些不知耶拉冈德的蒙昧之人，一旦目视五彩极光，也会自然被感化，向祂祷告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "长老A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "由此来看，一夜之间变得虔信，反而是祂威能的展现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不论恩希欧迪斯心中有什么想法，他的行为是无可非议的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然他所作所为是在维护信仰，圣女大人就不必有所顾虑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢拉格人终究要向千年的传统低头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但愿如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了恩希欧迪斯，另外两族的家主会和往常一样上山等候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你将作为圣女接受三族权力移交，要准备的绝不仅仅是一番得体的言辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣猎也好，大典也好，但凡你对待三家的态度稍有偏颇，人们立刻会将其解读为一家得势或失势的信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白手中圣铃之重，也考虑好了如何应对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只差一样，狩猎用的长弓，还请大长老允许我取用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩雅，你熟读历任圣女的手札，应该清楚，圣女不必亲自参与狩猎。这副长弓，你可是打算在圣猎开始的仪式上用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女虽然不必亲历狩猎，但要是亲自参与了，应该也不算对耶拉冈德不敬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "千年来蔓珠院的传统一向如此，圣女大人，不可不顾身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "圣女大人须代耶拉冈德接受三族奉上的猎物，代耶拉冈德将食物带到大典赐予祂的子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是这猎物改为圣女大人亲手狩猎而来，成何体统？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外，眼下也不是适合您游猎的季节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您说得对，千年来倒是从未有过三族将大权交还蔓珠院的先例。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是交权一事，本应为缓和之策，可这些日子以来，圣山下却频频爆发混乱，将要交归圣女的土地也被肆意毁坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就好像，他们当真不怕触怒耶拉冈德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德的子民正需要圣女大人去平息祂的怒火，向祂展现人们千年不变的虔诚之心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许耶拉冈德需要圣女去传达祂的怒火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......圣殿之上，切莫妄言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外，“勤劳者必将掌权，懒惰者必将受苦”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我虽然知道三族交权于圣女，并非要圣女掌握实权。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但圣女要维护信仰的地位，就不能只是等待着三族奉上结果，这并不是要展现他们的无能——而是我要首先做出表率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大长老",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若要维护，就不可能谈什么改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德的子民已经向前走了，他们向祂祈祷的东西一定与千年前不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祂也一定，无法做出与千年前相同的回应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说老爷清晨从希瓦艾什家的老宅子出发，一路靠双脚走到这里，还没有休息过，连一口水也没喝上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸，咱们给老爷送碗水去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民D",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真要遵照传统的话，老爷这一路，确实要不吃不喝，不眠不休。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可......已经一天了，爸。去圣山的路程，到我们这镇上才刚过半。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且前面出了镇子，天也要黑了，雪原上不知道会有什么危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民D",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，老爷来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黄昏的街道上，希瓦艾什的队伍沉默地走来。恩希欧迪斯低垂着头，双掌合十，无声地朝向远方的圣山祷告。\n听到脚步声的人们好奇地从窗口探出头，或者走出房门站在街道两侧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是不能给老爷送碗水喝......我想跟着他到圣山脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格平民C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷开工厂教我技术的时候，我就决定跟着他。现在老爷心诚，要去拜圣山，我更要跟着他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人们一言不发地站起身，走下楼去，跟在希瓦艾什家护卫队的后面，步入雪原。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
